*Note: Update this structure as the project grows and additional folders and files are added.*

## Development Notes

- The backend uses Express.js to handle server requests.
- PostgreSQL stores application data.
- Database connections are managed through a connection pool in `db/pool.js`.
- Environment variables are used to keep credentials and configuration separate from source code.
- The project uses Git and GitHub for version control and collaboration.

